      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JASPER DARKE (7) is an honest type rarely out of the money, scoring at this track (22.75) last time and making it two straight wins. Form here at the trip sound including 17 wins. Drawn wide but with a clean break will be tough to beat again. BARRAMUNDI LOU (1) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at this track behind STAR (23.01) in a Grade 4/5. Has the pace to be prominent. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Expected to be in the finish again. WHISKY BENT (3) finished fourth last time but the start prior broke the clock when winning over 388m at Gosford, taking a Grade 5 in a solid 22.19. Smart winner two back and looks a key chance on that form. STAR (8) comes under notice as a past winner at this course and distance.",
